{"ref":"BDB, מָצוֹק²","hw":"מָצוֹק²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָצוֹק</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>straitness, straits, stress</strong>;—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־אִישׁ מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.2\">1 S 22:2</a> <em>every man of straits</em> (in straits); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּמָצוֹר וּבְמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:53\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.53\">Dt 28:53</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:55\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.55\">55</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:57\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.57\">57</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.9\">Je 19:9</a> (all of national <em>straits</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">צַר־וּמ׳ מְצָאוּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:143\" href=\"/Psalms.119.143\">ψ 119:143</a>; perhaps read <span dir=\"rtl\">מָצוֹק</span> also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:6\" href=\"/Psalms.32.6\">32:6</a>, for <span dir=\"rtl\">מצא רק</span>, cf. Du Br.","next":"BDB, מְצוּקָה","prev":"BDB, מוּצָק⁴"}